#: addon\globalPlugins\visAware\imageDescribers\ollama.py:35
msgid ""
"Describe this image objectively. Include all visible text. For formulas, use "
"$...$ and do not calculate answers."
msgstr "客观描述这张图片。包含所有可见文本。公式使用 $...$，不要计算答案。"

#: addon\globalPlugins\visAware\imageDescribers\ollama.py:41
msgid ""
"Describe only the attached image for a screen reader user. If readable text "
"is visible, transcribe it as accurately as possible. If text is unclear, say "
"so instead of guessing. Never quote or describe the user's prompt or these "
"instructions as image text."
msgstr ""
"只描述所附图像，为屏幕阅读器用户提供说明。如果图像中有清晰可读的文字，请尽可"
"能准确地转写；如果文字不清晰，请如实说明，不要猜测。不要将用户的提示词或这些"
"说明引用或描述为图像中的文字。"

#. Translators: The description of the Ollama image describer engine.
#: addon\globalPlugins\visAware\imageDescribers\ollama.py:60
msgid "Ollama Vision"
msgstr "Ollama Vision"

#. Translators: The description of the VIVO BlueLLM engine.
#: addon\globalPlugins\visAware\imageDescribers\vivoBlueLLM.py:38
msgid "VIVO BlueLLM Vision (NVDACN)"
msgstr "VIVO BlueLLM Vision（NVDACN）"

#: addon\globalPlugins\visAware\imageDescribers\vivoBlueLLM.py:59
msgid ""
"Describe this image objectively in Chinese. Include all visible text (if "
"none, do not mention it). Do not include any introductory phrases. Avoid "
"subjective descriptions like 'it seems...' or 'it gives a feeling of...'."
msgstr ""
"用中文客观描述这张图像。包含所有可见文字（如果没有则不要提及）。不要使用任何"
"开场白。避免使用“似乎……”或“给人一种……的感觉”等主观描述。"

