#: addon\globalPlugins\visAware\imageDescribers\vivoImageDescriber.py:295
msgid "Description filtered (image may be blurry)."
msgstr "描述已被过滤（图像可能模糊）。"

#. Translators: A message indicating the image description was filtered because its confidence score was below the user-defined threshold.
#: addon\globalPlugins\visAware\imageDescribers\vivoImageDescriber.py:299
msgid "Description filtered (confidence score below threshold)."
msgstr "描述已被过滤（置信度低于阈值）。"

